      "type": "text", "id": "l3_text",
      "x": 90, "y": 384, "width": 660, "height": 69,
      "text": "Livello 3  —  \"Fallo lavorare in autonomia\"\nAgents + /loop + team. Claude lavora overnight, apre PR, risponde a issue. Tu orchestra e reviewi.",
